  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.6 (kirici, urun migration ister): saat bildirimin kendisidir - ReminderAlarm yeniden sekillendi (Kind Due/EarlyWarning/Snooze, OffsetMinutes goreli, FireAt nullable, LastFiredAt; Status/FiredAt/Error/AttemptCount/FromRecurrence ve ReminderAlarmStatus kalkti), ReminderAlarmPlanner tek kaynak, Reminder.OccurrenceCount/Color/Tags (ReminderTag), Notification.AlarmId yerine FireAt ve (ReminderId, FireAt, OwnerUserId) tekil indeksi, DTO EarlyWarningMinutes/Color/Tags, AddAlarm/RemoveAlarm kalkti, api/Reminders/Tags, ReminderLimits; hub yalniz WebSocket ve Master bileti (RemindersHubTicket, tek kullanim deposu, HubConnectionLifetimeMinutes), RemindersOptions MaxAttempts/RetryDelayMinutes kalkti. 1.0.5 (migration gerekmez): bildirim listesi - NotificationDTO.Visibility (kaynak hatirlaticinin simdiki gorunurlugu, hatirlatici yoksa null), NotificationQueryDTO.Arama ve Gorunurluk (NotificationVisibilityFilter), NotificationQuery yardimcisi (Normalize/Validate/ApplyFilter/Project); bildirim erisimi yine yalniz OwnerUserId == ben. 1.0.4: Isletme notlari/hatirlatici (kirici, urun migration ister): RecordVisibility (Personal=0, Business=1) ve RecordVisibilityFilter; Note.Visibility, Reminder.Visibility (varsayilan 0) ve indeksler (Visibility, IsPinned) / (Visibility, IsCompleted, DueAt); Notification tekil indeksi AlarmId yerine (AlarmId, OwnerUserId). RecordAccess: erisim kuralinin tek kaynagi (NoteReadable/NoteWritable, ReminderReadable/ReminderWritable, alt madde/alarm/etiket/ek ifadeleri, liste suzgecleri, CanChangeVisibility, RemoveNonOwnerNotificationsAsync); bos kullanici kimligi hicbir satirla eslesmez. Yeni IReminderRecipientResolver (ActiveUserIdsAsync, DisplayNamesAsync): ReminderDispatchService isletme hatirlaticisinda her aktif kullaniciya ayri bildirim uretir (ayni transaction), commit sonrasi alici basina tek push; cozumleyici yoksa ya da bos donerse bildirim uretilmez. DTO'lara Visibility, CreatedByName, IsMine ve Gorunurluk suzgeci eklendi.",
